け","en":"If you dare speak disrespectfully of the Master, I'll tear you apart with this Shiva. Be prepared."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00670_1/uni00670_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"部隊というにはここは随分とたるんでいる。強者がいるのにそれを活かせていない","en":"This place is far too lax to be called a unit. There are strong fighters here, yet we're not using them."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00670_1/uni00670_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"紅血卿に会いたい……？　あのお方がお前如きに会うなど――いや、そんなはずはない！","en":"You want to see the Crimson Blood Lord…? That person would never meet someone like you—no, that's impossible!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00670_1/uni00670_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"本来私は主様の護衛として常に側に仕えるべきなのに……しかし、これも主様の命、しかと果たさなければ","en":"I'm supposed to be the Master's guard, always by his side… but this is also the Master's command, and I must fulfill it."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00670_1/uni00670_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"私の家系は代々紅血卿へと仕えてきたが、そうでなくとも私は主様へと全てを捧げただろう","en":"My family has served the Crimson Blood Lord for generations, and even if that weren't the case, I would have devoted everything to the Master."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00670_1/uni00670_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":1,"text":{"ja":"んぅっ、くぅっ……！　な、縄が食い込むっ、はぁはぁ、こんな無様な姿を晒す程に体が熱いぃっ……！","en":"Nn… ku…! The rope's digging in… *pant* *pant* My body's so hot I can't even hide this pathetic state…!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00670_1_hom_r18_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":2,"text":{"ja":"ふふ、私のマンコにぶち込みたいか……？　ああ、太く長く反りかえり、馬チンポにもまさるともおとらない……☆","en":"Hehe, do you want to thrust into my pussy…? Ah, it's so thick, long, and curved, it could even outdo a horse's cock…☆"},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00670_1_hom_r18_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":3,"text":{"ja":"この肌へ白濁した欲望をぶちまけたいと考えているんだろう？　ふふ、溺れるほどに穢されるのを想像してしまう","en":"You're thinking of pouring that milky desire onto my skin, aren't you? Hehe, I can already imagine being so filthy I'd drown in it."},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00670_1_hom_r18_3.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00670_1/uni00670_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00670_1/uni00670_1_atk_2.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00670_1/uni00670_1_atk_3.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00670_1/uni00670_1_dmg_1.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00670_1/uni00670_1_dmg_2.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00670_1/uni00670_1_dmg_3.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00670_1/uni00670_1_evo_1.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00670_1/uni00670_1_evo_2.ogg"},{"type":"lup","label":"Level Up","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00670_1/uni00670_1_lup_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00670_1/uni00670_1_msr_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00670_1/uni00670_1_msr_2.ogg"},{"type":"rdy","label":"Battle Start","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00670_1/uni00670_1_rdy_1.ogg"},{"type":"rdy","label":"Battle Start","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00670_1/uni00670_1_rdy_2.ogg"},{"type":"res","label":"Result","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00670_1/uni00670_1_res_1.ogg"},{